1
00:00:00,837 --> 00:00:04,707
(Sheldon:)oh, and last, but not least,
teenagers with guitars.

2
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,740
(Penny:)I'll see
if it's available.

3
00:00:08,745 --> 00:00:11,315
(Amy:)You know,
if that study's real,

4
00:00:11,315 --> 00:00:12,945
(Amy:)Leonard might come back
smarter than you.

5
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:16,120
(Sheldon:)Are you trying to manipulate me?
Yes.

6
00:00:16,119 --> 00:00:17,289
(Sheldon:)Well done, it worked,
we're going.

7
00:00:17,287 --> 00:00:18,717
Yay!

8
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:21,860
(bags rustling)
BERNADETTE: Come on, Raj,

9
00:00:21,858 --> 00:00:23,528
(Bernadette:)give me a bag.

10
00:00:23,527 --> 00:00:24,627
(Raj:)No, no, you're pregnant.

11
00:00:24,628 --> 00:00:26,298
(Raj:)The only thing you carry

12
00:00:26,296 --> 00:00:29,436
(Raj:)is our hope
for a better tomorrow.

13
00:00:30,467 --> 00:00:32,567
(Howard:)Hey, where you been?

14
00:00:32,569 --> 00:00:34,469
(Bernadette:)Uh, Raj took me
to the baby doctor

15
00:00:34,471 --> 00:00:35,841
(Bernadette:)and then we swung by
the grocery store.

16
00:00:35,839 --> 00:00:37,309
(tires screeching on game)
Did you get graham crackers?

17
00:00:37,307 --> 00:00:41,577
I mean, are... what...
is the baby okay?

18
00:00:41,578 --> 00:00:43,478
(Bernadette:)Yes and yes.

19
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:44,750
(sighs)

20
00:00:44,748 --> 00:00:46,748
(Howard:)I didn't know you needed help
running errands today.

21
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,380
(Howard:)I didn't,
but Raj volunteered.

22
00:00:48,385 --> 00:00:49,515
(Howard:)Really?

23
00:00:49,519 --> 00:00:50,719
(Bernadette:)Yeah, ever since you told him
I was pregnant,

24
00:00:50,721 --> 00:00:52,351
(Bernadette:)he's really been making
a fuss over me.

25
00:00:52,356 --> 00:00:54,826
(Howard:)Oh. Well, I guess
that's kind of sweet.

26
00:00:54,825 --> 00:00:58,725
(Raj:)Bernie, I just
forwarded you a list

27
00:00:58,729 --> 00:01:01,799
(Raj:)of the top five lactation
consultants in Los Angeles.

